# <type>(<scope>): <short summary, imperative present tense, <=72 chars>
#
# Body (optional) - explain WHY this change was made, not what the diff
# already shows. Wrap at ~72 chars.
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, chore, refactor, test, ci, perf
# Scope: module or component touched, e.g. terraform, ci, kubernetes, app
#
# Rules:
#   - No AI tool attribution, assistant names, or "Generated with" lines.
#   - No Co-authored-by trailers unless a real second human contributed.
#   - Reference an issue/ticket with "Refs #123" if one exists.
